  "finding": "Scaled spatial training improves held-out pixel error, but swapping paired actions does not reliably worsen held-out predictions; action-outcome grounding is not demonstrated. The MLP fits validation while worsening evaluation. Neither model is promoted to the Heliox runtime.",
